{{Bug|Tainted Judas in his {{i|Dark Arts}} state can be affected by {{i|Pause}}, this results in Tainted Judas being stuck in his shadow form whilst not being able to fire any tears as long as Pause is still in effect, this can be fixed by quitting then entering the game again. Moreover if this bug happens while Tainted Judas has {{I|Birthright}}, the dark aura around Tainted Judas will experience a visual bug from Pause that is similar to {{i|Monstrance}} with Pause.}}

